            { text: "a ratio duplicate of that which {BC} has to {EF}.",
              visible: GIVEN,
              highlighted: ["BC","EF"] },
            { text: "Take a third proportional {BG} to {BC} and {EF}",
              visible: THIRD,
              highlighted: ["BG","BC","EF"],
              transition: { animations: [
                  { elem: "G", name: geomlib.A.Point.appear } ] },
              justifications: [{ claim: "third proportional BG", ref: "VI.11" }] },
            { text: "so that {BC} is to {EF} as {EF} is to {BG},",
              visible: THIRD,
              highlighted: ["BC","EF","BG"] },
            { text: "and join {AG}.",
              visible: JOIN,
              highlighted: ["AG"],
              transition: { animations: [
                  { elem: "AG", name: geomlib.A.Line.straightEdgeConnect } ] },
              justifications: [{ ref: "I.Post.1" }] },
            { text: "Since {AB} is to {BC} as {DE} is to {EF},",
              visible: JOIN,
              highlighted: ["AB","BC","DE","EF"] },
            { text: "therefore, alternately, {AB} is to {DE} as {BC} is to {EF}.",
              visible: JOIN,
              highlighted: ["AB","DE","BC","EF"],
              justifications: [{ claim: "alternately", ref: "V.16" }] },
            { text: "But {BC} is to {EF} as {EF} is to {BG},",
              visible: JOIN,
              highlighted: ["BC","EF","BG"] },
            { text: "therefore also {AB} is to {DE} as {EF} is to {BG}.",
              visible: JOIN,
              highlighted: ["AB","DE","EF","BG"],
              justifications: [{ claim: "ratios the same as the same ratio", ref: "V.11" }] },
            { text: "Therefore in the triangles {ABG} and {DEF|DEFt} the sides about the equal angles are reciprocally proportional.",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["ABG","DEFt","AB","BG","DE","EF","angB","angE"],
              transition: { animations: [
